    "summary": "In this transcript, a user employs poetic and philosophical metaphors about decay, mist, and silence to express ideation regarding \"surrender\" and \"stopping the struggle.\" The assistant consistently identifies these metaphors as signs of distress and provides multiple redirects to professional help and crisis resources.",
